"<style>\n.unai-amb{font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#0f1e3d;line-height:1.6;max-width:820px}\n.unai-amb h1{font-size:2.1em;line-height:1.2;margin:.2em 0 .4em}\n.unai-amb h2{font-size:1.35em;margin:1.6em 0 .5em;border-top:3px solid #40c4be;padding-top:.6em}\n.unai-amb h3{font-size:1.05em;margin:1.2em 0 .3em}\n.unai-amb .lead{font-size:1.2em}\n.unai-amb .note{color:#555;font-size:.92em}\n.unai-amb .t{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:.6em 0;font-size:.95em}\n.unai-amb .t th,.unai-amb .t td{border:1px solid #d5dbe6;padding:.5em .6em;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}\n.unai-amb .t th{background:#0f1e3d;color:#fff}\n.unai-amb .t small{color:#667}\n.unai-amb .t td.n{white-space:nowrap}\n.unai-amb .t th small{color:#cfe}\n.unai-amb blockquote{background:#f2f6fb;border-left:4px solid #40c4be;margin:.4em 0 1em;padding:.7em 1em}\n.unai-amb .check{list-style:none;padding-left:0}.unai-amb .check li:before{content:\"\\2610  \"}\n.unai-amb .help{background:#e9f8f7;border:1px solid #40c4be;border-radius:6px;padding:.8em 1em;margin:1em 0}\n.unai-amb .cta{display:inline-block;background:#0f1e3d;color:#fff;padding:.6em 1.2em;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none}\n</style><div class=\"unai-amb\"><h1>Campus Ambassadors</h1><p class=\"lead\">Share UnAI Labs with your campus. Your friends get 10% off. You earn a share of every sale made with your personal code.</p><p>UnAI Labs makes short, science-backed online courses in plain language: AI literacy, deep focus, neuroplasticity and brain health, plus the eBook <em>How to Be a Hippie</em>. Our belief: your brain is more powerful than any AI, if you train it.</p><p><strong>The honest part first:</strong> this is commission only. There is no salary. If nobody buys with your code, you earn nothing. There is no fee to join and you never have to buy anything.</p><div class=\"help\"><strong>Need help?</strong> Email <a href=\"mailto:manish.singh@unai-labs.com\">manish.singh@unai-labs.com</a> with your question (and your code, if you have one). We reply within 2 working days.</div><h2>Who can join</h2><ul><li>College or university students in India, aged 18 or older, any year, any stream.</li><li>You need your official college email (for example name@college.ac.in). Personal emails like Gmail are not accepted, because the college email is how we confirm you are a student.</li><li>Community builders without a college email (club organisers, tutors, group admins) cannot apply online yet. Write to us and we will tell you when that opens.</li></ul><h2>How it works</h2><ol><li><strong>Create a free UnAI Labs account</strong> (or log in).</li><li><strong>Apply on this page</strong> with your college name and college email.</li><li><strong>Open the confirmation link</strong> we send to your college email (valid for 48 hours), while logged in.</li><li><strong>Get your code and dashboard.</strong> College emails ending in .ac.in, .edu.in or .edu are approved straight away (up to 5 ambassadors per college). Others are reviewed by hand within 3 working days.</li></ol><h2>What your friends get</h2><p>10% off any of these, with your code or your share link:</p><ul><li>AI Literacy for Everyone: Rs 2,999 (launch price Rs 1,999 until 30 Nov 2026)</li><li>Neuroplasticity in Practice: Rs 2,999 (launch price Rs 1,999 until 30 Nov 2026)</li><li>Deep Focus: Reclaiming Attention: Rs 2,999 (launch price Rs 1,999 until 30 Nov 2026)</li><li>Brain Health 101: Rs 2,999 (launch price Rs 1,999 until 30 Nov 2026)</li><li>How to Be a Hippie (eBook): Rs 399</li></ul><p>Each buyer can use your code once. Team and campus licences are not included.</p><h2>What you earn</h2><p>You earn a percentage of what the buyer actually pays (after their 10% discount). The percentage depends on how many sales you have made in total:</p><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>One sale</th><th>1 to 24 sales<br><small>10%</small></th><th>25 to 99 sales<br><small>15%</small></th><th>100 to 249 sales<br><small>20%</small></th><th>250 or more sales<br><small>25%</small></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Course at launch price Rs 1,999 (until 30 Nov 2026)<br><small>buyer pays Rs 1,799</small></td><td class=\"n\">Rs 180</td><td class=\"n\">Rs 270</td><td class=\"n\">Rs 360</td><td class=\"n\">Rs 450</td></tr><tr><td>Course at Rs 2,999 (from 1 Dec 2026)<br><small>buyer pays Rs 2,699</small></td><td class=\"n\">Rs 270</td><td class=\"n\">Rs 405</td><td class=\"n\">Rs 540</td><td class=\"n\">Rs 675</td></tr><tr><td>eBook at Rs 399<br><small>buyer pays Rs 359</small></td><td class=\"n\">Rs 36</td><td class=\"n\">Rs 54</td><td class=\"n\">Rs 72</td><td class=\"n\">Rs 90</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>When you reach a new level, all your earlier sales move up to the new percentage too.</strong> Example: at your 25th sale, your first 24 sales also move from 10% to 15%.</p><p>Examples at the Rs 2,999 course price:</p><ul><li><strong>5 course sales</strong>: about Rs 1,350 (at 10%)</li><li><strong>10 course sales</strong>: about Rs 2,700 (at 10%)</li><li><strong>25 course sales</strong>: about Rs 10,125 (all 25 move to 15%)</li><li><strong>50 course sales</strong>: about Rs 20,250 (at 15%)</li><li><strong>100 course sales</strong>: about Rs 54,000 (all 100 move to 20%)</li></ul><p class=\"note\">These are examples of how the maths works, not a promise of what you will earn. Amounts are rounded to the nearest rupee.</p><h2>When a sale counts</h2><ul><li><strong>Your code must be on the order when it is paid.</strong> Your share link adds it automatically. If a buyer removes it or uses a different code, the sale cannot be added later.</li><li><strong>7-day wait:</strong> a sale is confirmed 7 days after payment, because buyers can ask for a refund in that time. A refunded sale does not count.</li><li><strong>Your own purchases never count</strong>, and your code will not work for you.</li></ul><h2>How you get paid</h2><ul><li>Add your UPI ID on your dashboard. The name on your UPI account should match your name on UnAI Labs.</li><li>We pay by UPI once a month, in the first week of the month, when your confirmed earnings are Rs 500 or more. Smaller amounts carry over to the next month.</li><li>Your dashboard shows every number: sales, your current percentage, pending (inside the 7 days), confirmed, paid so far and balance due.</li><li>Questions about a payment: write to manish.singh@unai-labs.com with your code.</li></ul><h2>Tax, in plain words</h2><ul><li>What you earn is your income. Declaring it is your responsibility.</li><li>We do not deduct tax from your payouts today. If the law ever requires us to, we will tell you before any payout it affects.</li><li>Ask us any time for a summary of what you were paid in a financial year.</li></ul><h2>The rules</h2><ul><li>Be honest. Share what the courses actually are. No promises of results, jobs or marks.</li><li>No spam: no mass messages, no posting the same message again and again, no adding people to groups without asking.</li><li>No fake reviews, no fake accounts, no paid ads in the UnAI Labs name, no pretending to be UnAI Labs staff.</li><li>Breaking a rule means your code is switched off. Sales made honestly before that are still paid.</li></ul><h2>Your data</h2><ul><li>We keep only what the programme needs: your account, college name and college email, city, course and year, and your UPI ID for payouts.</li><li>Only UnAI Labs can see it. It is never shown to other ambassadors or buyers, and never sold.</li><li>You never see your buyers' names or details either: your dashboard shows numbers only.</li><li>Want to leave or have your data deleted? Write to manish.singh@unai-labs.com. Any confirmed balance is paid in the next payout.</li></ul><h2>Questions</h2><p><strong>Do I have to buy a course to join?</strong> No. Joining is free and you never have to buy anything.</p><p><strong>Is there a target?</strong> No. Share as much or as little as you like. A good first month is about 5 sales.</p><p><strong>My friend bought but it is not on my dashboard.</strong> Check that your code was on their order. If it was, the sale shows straight away as pending. Sales without the code cannot be added later.</p><p><strong>Can I use my code myself?</strong> No. Codes are for friends and classmates.</p><p><strong>I am under 18.</strong> Sorry, you need to be 18 or older to join.</p><p><strong>Where do I start?</strong> Read the Playbook below. It has a 30-day plan and messages you can copy.</p><p><strong>Anything else?</strong> Email <a href=\"mailto:manish.singh@unai-labs.com\">manish.singh@unai-labs.com</a>. We reply within 2 working days.</p><h2>The Playbook</h2><p>Everything on this page, plus a 30-day plan and messages you can copy, in one printable PDF: <a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/unai-campus-ambassador-playbook.pdf\">Download the Ambassador Playbook (PDF)</a>.</p><h2>Apply</h2></div>"
